Origin: EmberBSD (AI-assisted), not submitted upstream.
Identify self-join through thread-local object identity. Reading the OS handle
before taking runningMutex races its reset during natural completion. This
keeps the public signatures and object layout. Raw handle/ID getters still
require external lifecycle synchronization.

